<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank sets $700,000 in o/n repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank sets $700,000 in o/n repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Tuesday it placed $700,000 in overnight repurchase agreements at 9.0 percent.</p>
<p>Call money rose to 6.6 percent from 6.3 percent at the close Monday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar slipped to 0.99982 peso from 0.99985 peso at the close Monday.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsromm +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
